{
  "_comment": [
    "How each DD1 zone is fought in DD2. Our own mapping (no game data), edit freely.",
    "Battle entries: 'table:<id>' rolls a DD2 BattleConfigurationTable, 'config:<id>' is one BattleConfiguration.",
    "Difficulty keys are DD1's: 1 apprentice, 3 veteran, 5 champion, 6 Darkest Dungeon.",
    "Arenas are DD2 combat_arena_* scenes; the plugin checks each one exists and skips any that don't.",
    "Faction choice follows DD2's own region natives: forest = Lost Battalion, farm = Plague Eaters,",
    "city = Fanatics, coast = Coastal crews, caves = Swine, mountain = the Cult.",
    "dd2_* zones are the main destinations, with DD1 areas optional: 'dd1_zone' is the DD1 zone whose maps,",
    "curios, quest tables and loot they borrow; 'region_boss' is the lair boss their kill-boss quests send you to."
  ],
